{"hw":"λυκόω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">λυκόω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">λυκόω</span>, (<span class=\"lex-etym gk\">λύκος</span>) <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">tear like a wolf</b>:—<span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span>, <b class=\"lex-tr\">to be torn by wolves</b>, <span class=\"gk\">πρόβατα λελυκωμένα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cyr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.3.41</span> </span>.</div></div>"}